{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This visual novel takes place in a fantasy world where humans, gods, and spirits coexist. The  protagonist has a curse that draws entities (strangelings) to her, so she must find a way to break the curse. She meets two gods who can help her fulfill her objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940920/extras/480082e596fdd467443e8b07978af06b.avif?t=1762305239\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zenith</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zenith is the god of luck with a playful nature. He is associated with cats and is known to provoke others for fun, often to the extreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940920/extras/1002d43a8355882b2ddf4fa1bf97bf60.avif?t=1762305239\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sirius</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sirius is a mysterious old god who is connected to the protagonist. He is associated with wolves and is usually not very friendly. He likes to smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trigger warnings</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashing lights</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like any other visual novel, the player will advance the story by selecting options and clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first game, so the story is somewhat linear, and the gameplay is basic. The game will take around 80 minutes to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for buying this visual novel, and I hope you enjoy it!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2940920?t=1762305239","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940920/e23d7f27a7bcdb0e8420ebaa66be61f78f86abb6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762305239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940920/66b1a6e672b161aecd516147ae970cc402cd7596/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762305239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940920/66b1a6e672b161aecd516147ae970cc402cd7596/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762305239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is only one very brief scene in the story of an implied attempted assault. Other mature scenes are of characters killing each other/themselves."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This visual novel takes place in a fantasy world where humans, gods, and spirits coexist. The  protagonist has a curse that draws entities (strangelings) to her, so she must find a way to break the curse. She meets two gods who can help her fulfill her objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940920/extras/480082e596fdd467443e8b07978af06b.avif?t=1762305239\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zenith</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zenith is the god of luck with a playful nature. He is associated with cats and is known to provoke others for fun, often to the extreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940920/extras/1002d43a8355882b2ddf4fa1bf97bf60.avif?t=1762305239\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sirius</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sirius is a mysterious old god who is connected to the protagonist. He is associated with wolves and is usually not very friendly. He likes to smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trigger warnings</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashing lights</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like any other visual novel, the player will advance the story by selecting options and clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first game, so the story is somewhat linear, and the gameplay is basic. The game will take around 80 minutes to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for buying this visual novel, and I hope you enjoy it!</p>","developers":["FebruMar LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940920/20ba1a8843b1cf24b7e1ff80f2999fb85261db95/header.jpg?t=1762305239","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</stron